## Proposed Changes

### 1. First-Time Tenant Setup (Onboarding)
When a new Court Admin (Tenant) logs into the application for the very first time, they will be prompted with a setup modal to provide:
- **Academy Name**
- **Contact Information**
- Default configuration seed (so they don't start from an entirely blank slate).

### 2. Database Schema Overhaul (Firestore)
Instead of a global `iraguRates` object in the frontend, each Tenant will have a dedicated `settings` document in Firestore (`academies/{academyId}/settings`). This document will follow the JSON schema you provided (Programs, Hourly Slots, Coaching Schedule, Fee Structure).

